WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.932
Today we will present performance work as a team. Our work connects with selected

00:00:04.932 --> 00:00:06.621
artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:13.090
Agree on the order of songs, dance or drama items. Name a design choice that a

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:14.853
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.708
Rehearse entry, performance and respectful exit.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.495
Present the item and thank the audience at the end.
